sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as Streamlit app
    participant Pipeline
    participant MCP as adversal-cli
    participant Backend as Adversal backend

    User->>App: Upload video or submit URL
    App->>Pipeline: submit_job(options)
    Pipeline->>MCP: process_video(...)
    MCP->>Backend: Start remote analysis
    Backend-->>MCP: request_id
    MCP-->>Pipeline: request_id
    Pipeline-->>App: Persist RUNNING job

    loop Every 8 seconds
        App->>Pipeline: render_job_progress()
        Pipeline->>MCP: check_video_status(request_id)
        MCP->>Backend: Read status
        Backend-->>Pipeline: RUNNING / COMPLETED / FAILED
    end

    alt Authentication required
        Pipeline-->>App: Set auth_required
        User->>App: Authenticate
        App->>MCP: authenticate()
    else Completed
        Pipeline-->>App: Persist COMPLETED + artifacts
        App-->>User: Notes, frames, Ask, Create
    else Failed
        Pipeline-->>App: Persist FAILED + error
        App-->>User: Failure and start-over controls
    end
